        <mxCell id="nV5ekS6hgRPHdBKqXmPx-20" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=16;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;autosizeText=0;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: inherit; margin-block: 0.75rem; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 1.5rem; quotes: &amp;quot;“&amp;quot; &amp;quot;”&amp;quot; &amp;quot;‘&amp;quot; &amp;quot;’&amp;quot;; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; quotes: &amp;quot;“&amp;quot; &amp;quot;”&amp;quot; &amp;quot;‘&amp;quot; &amp;quot;’&amp;quot;; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-block: 0px 0.125rem; margin-inline: 0px; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;¿Qué existe realmente: solo materia, o también ideas, almas, números?&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; quotes: &amp;quot;“&amp;quot; &amp;quot;”&amp;quot; &amp;quot;‘&amp;quot; &amp;quot;’&amp;quot;; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-block: 0.125rem; margin-inline: 0px; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;¿Qué significa &quot;ser&quot;? Aristóteles ya distinguía múltiples sentidos del verbo ser (ser algo, ser tal, ser esto o aquello).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; quotes: &amp;quot;“&amp;quot; &amp;quot;”&amp;quot; &amp;quot;‘&amp;quot; &amp;quot;’&amp;quot;; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-block: 0.125rem 0px; margin-inline: 0px; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;La discusión entre &lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700; quotes: &amp;quot;“&amp;quot; &amp;quot;”&amp;quot; &amp;quot;‘&amp;quot; &amp;quot;’&amp;quot;; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;realismo&lt;/span&gt; (la realidad existe independiente de nosotros) y &lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700; quotes: &amp;quot;“&amp;quot; &amp;quot;”&amp;quot; &amp;quot;‘&amp;quot; &amp;quot;’&amp;quot;; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;idealismo&lt;/span&gt; (lo mental/consciente es fundamental) es esencialmente ontológica.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="325" x="806" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nV5ekS6hgRPHdBKqXmPx-21" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=16;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;autosizeText=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Puede ser cualquier clasificación de las cosas que existen&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
